      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE SHARED CORE</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"100\" width=\"960\" height=\"250\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE BODY</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">die Hand</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">hand</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">der Finger</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">finger</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">der Arm</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">arm</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"20\">Same words. Say them and you are speaking German.</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"380\" width=\"960\" height=\"280\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.10)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">HOME AND TABLE</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">das Haus</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">house</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">das Buch</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">book</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">das Brot</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">bread</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">das Wasser</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">water</text><text x=\"720\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">die Milch</text><text x=\"720\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">milk</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"690\" width=\"960\" height=\"240\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.10)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">HOW THINGS ARE</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">gut = good</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">alt = old</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">jung = young</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">kalt = cold</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">warm = warm</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">hier = here</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"905\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"20\">mein = mine, my</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"985\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"20\">der / die / das = German's three genders - lesson 3 explains.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Sixteen everyday German words that English speakers already half-know: the body, the home, and basic adjectives."
