     "explanation": "Run the decoder: pf → p gives 'pa-', and final d → th gives '-th'. Pfad = path. This is exactly how the patterns pay off — hundreds of German words become guessable once you see through the shifts.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">DECODE THE WORD</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"130\" width=\"500\" height=\"150\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">der Pfad</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">(pfaht) - a word you have never seen</text><path d=\"M 550 300 L 550 370\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M 550 380 L 535 355 L 565 355 Z\" fill=\"#ffd700\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"410\" width=\"380\" height=\"140\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">KEY 1</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">German pf = English p</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"410\" width=\"380\" height=\"140\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">KEY 2</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">German d = English th</text><path d=\"M 550 590 L 550 650\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M 550 660 L 535 635 L 565 635 Z\" fill=\"#ffd700\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"690\" width=\"500\" height=\"150\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"40\">p _ _ _h ?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">apply both keys - what English word appears?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Something you walk along through a forest...</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">This is the decoder skill from the last two cards.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Apply the two shift keys to der Pfad and an everyday English word appears."
     }
