     "explanation": "Bitte's double life: it means please when you're asking, and you're welcome when someone thanks you. Thanking them back (Danke) would be odd, Entschuldigung apologises for nothing, and Bis bald (see you soon) promises a reunion the stranger isn't expecting.",
