      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE DOOR IN BERLIN</text><rect x=\"470\" y=\"130\" width=\"160\" height=\"300\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"280\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">you hold the door open</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"540\" width=\"440\" height=\"160\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M 250 700 L 280 750 L 320 700 Z\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">\"Danke schoen!\"</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"19\">the stranger, smiling</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"540\" width=\"440\" height=\"160\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 8\"/><path d=\"M 780 700 L 810 750 L 850 700 Z\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"790\" y=\"612\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">\" ??? \"</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"810\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.10)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">HINT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">One little German word lives a double life -</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">and one of its two jobs fits this exact moment.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "A stranger says Danke schoen - the right one-word reply is the double-life word from the politeness toolkit."
