"end\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">rounded ee</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"648\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">TSVAHN-tsish</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"110\" width=\"470\" height=\"280\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"805\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">STEP 2: CHECK</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Every miss points at</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">exactly one rule:</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">w = v - z = ts - ei / ie</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">final harden - final -ig</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"420\" width=\"470\" height=\"290\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"805\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\">STEP 3: ONE CLIP</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Any German audio, one minute.</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Listen for just three things:</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"24\">both ch sounds</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"662\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"24\">the r - the ue</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"770\" width=\"800\" height=\"200 \" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE FINISH LINE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"885\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">From lesson 3 onward, every German word</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">you meet is one you can pronounce.</text></svg>",
