     "explanation": "Vierundzwanzig is four-and-twenty = 24, and Euro fünfzig adds fifty cents, written after the comma decimal: 24,50 €. Hearing 42,50 is the reversal trap — forty-two would be zweiundvierzig. And fünfzig is fifty, not fünfzehn (fifteen).",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">WHAT IS ON THE DISPLAY?</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"740\" height=\"150\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">\"Das macht vierundzwanzig</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">Euro fuenfzig.\"</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"320\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"350\" y=\"370\" width=\"400\" height=\"140\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(26,26,46,0.9)\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"64\">??,?? EUR</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">the till display - Kasse</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"680\" width=\"420\" height=\"170\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">PIECE 1: THE EUROS</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"23\">vier + und + zwanzig</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">four-and-twenty = ?</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"680\" width=\"420\" height=\"170\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"770\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">PIECE 2: THE CENTS</text><text x=\"770\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"23\">Euro fuenfzig</text><text x=\"770\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">goes after the comma</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"890\" width=\"860\" height=\"130\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">REMEMBER THE GERMAN PRICE FORMAT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"988\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"23\">comma as decimal: euros , cents</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Vierundzwanzig Euro fünfzig: decode the units-first euros, then put the cents after the comma"
     }
