    {
     "type": "application",
     "title": "Your Numbers, Out Loud",
     "content": "Time to assemble your personal number kit — the four things people actually ask you for. Say each one aloud, in German, right now.\n\n**1. Your phone number.** Read it in pairs, each pair units-first, with **zwo** for 2: 0171 34 52 becomes **null eins sieben eins, vierunddreißig, zwoundfünfzig**. Write your real number down, split it into pairs, and read it twice — the second time faster.\n\n**2. Your birthday**, with the ordinal: **Ich habe am zwölften Juni Geburtstag.** (ish HAH-buh am TSVOELF-ten YOO-nee guh-BOORTS-tahk) — literally \"I have birthday on the twelfth June\" — my birthday is June 12th. Or state the date: **Mein Geburtstag ist der zwölfte Juni.** Swap in your own day and month — remember **am** + -ten, **der** + -te.\n\n**3. A time, both ways.** Take 15:30. Official: **fünfzehn Uhr dreißig**. Colloquial: **halb vier** — and you now know that is 3:30 in the afternoon, not 4:30. Do the same with the time on your phone right now.\n\n**4. Your age**, with sein from lesson 4: **Ich bin ... Jahre alt.** Build the number units-first if it has two digits — 34 is **vierunddreißig**.\n\nIf you can say these four without notes, you can survive a form, a doctor's reception desk and a new friend's questions. That is real, usable German — dreihundertfünfundsechzig days a year.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">YOUR PERSONAL NUMBER KIT</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"110\" width=\"920\" height=\"200\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"210\" r=\"45\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.3)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"44\">1</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"175\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PHONE NUMBER - in pairs</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">0171 34 52 = null eins sieben eins,</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">vierunddreissig, zwoundfuenfzig</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"340\" width=\"920\" height=\"200\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"440\" r=\"45\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.3)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"458\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"44\">2</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"405\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">BIRTHDAY - with the ordinal</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"455\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Ich habe am zwoelften Juni</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"495\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Geburtstag. - am + -ten</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"570\" width=\"920\" height=\"200\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"670\" r=\"45\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.3)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"688\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"44\">3</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"635\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">TIME - both systems</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"685\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">15:30 = fuenfzehn Uhr dreissig</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"725\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">= halb vier (yes, 3:30!)</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"800\" width=\"920\" height=\"200\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"900\" r=\"45\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.3)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"918\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"44\">4</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"865\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">AGE - with sein, like English</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"915\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Ich bin vierunddreissig Jahre alt.</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"955\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">- I am 34 years old.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1045\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">say all four out loud - no notes - that is the whole test</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The four numbers people ask for: phone in pairs, birthday with its ordinal, time in both systems, and age with sein"
     }
    }
