      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">ONE TABLE, ONE QUESTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">two guests, one server, and a fork in the road</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"260\" r=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.2)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\">Gast 1</text><circle cx=\"750\" cy=\"260\" r=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.2)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\">Gast 2</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"360\" width=\"600\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\">der Tisch - the table</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"480\" width=\"500\" height=\"90\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"518\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"bold\">\"Zusammen oder getrennt?\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"552\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">the server asks, pen ready</text><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"570\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"660\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"680\" y1=\"570\" x2=\"820\" y2=\"660\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"670\" width=\"420\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">zusammen</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"765\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">one bill: 37,00</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">one person pays everything</text><rect x=\"600\" y=\"670\" width=\"420\" height=\"180\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">getrennt</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"765\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">18,50 + 18,50</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">each guest pays their own</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"910\" width=\"800\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.08)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\">Getrennt is not rude and not unusual -</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"992\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">it is everyday practice, even among friends.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The server's question splits the bill two ways — and getrennt is the everyday, unremarkable option."
