     "explanation": "mal is the casualiser: Guck mal! — hey, look at this! denn belongs in questions (friendly interest), halt is the that's-just-how-it-is shrug, and schon as a particle reassures (Das wird schon). For a small, quick, friendly request, mal is the tool.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">WHICH PARTICLE FITS?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"30\">Guck ___!</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The moment: a quick, casual request</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">to a friend - no big deal</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"440\" width=\"380\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">mal?</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"550\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">casualiser</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"440\" width=\"380\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">denn?</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"550\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">question-friendliness</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"630\" width=\"380\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">halt?</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">the shrug</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"630\" width=\"380\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">schon?</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">reassurance</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"24\">Match the particle's JOB to the moment.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Each one has a job description, not a translation.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Four particles, four jobs — which one makes a request quick and casual?"
     }
